From 832c8a6d2fea40cb5e4e41bcfc0507b4b2acb339 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Matthew <matthewhale@live.com.au>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 22:39:23 +1100
Subject: [PATCH 38/59] XvT threat lights; ion cannons only disable TIEs

- render.xvt_cockpit: XvT's four threat lights above the gunsight (elements
  90-93) draw with XvT's panel sprites in both the cockpit and cockpit-off
  views. render_readout.c CaptureThreats follows Hud_UpdateThreatIndicators:
  a craft targeting the player with a cannon burst under way, a starship
  turret whose firingGate names the player, and the warhead lock (flashing,
  then steady). The beam light stays dark. All go dark with the weapon
  warning system damaged, as X-Wing's own light does.
- game.ion_disable_only ("Ion Cannons vs TIEs"): a TIE fighter, interceptor
  or bomber disabled by ions no longer gets X-Wing's 60-tick lifetime, so it
  stays disabled instead of exploding.
